{"format":1,"kind":"nrl","id":"nrl-2000","version":"nrl-2000-e5f801b0","year":2000,"season":"2000","label":"Computed from NRL.com match stats","local":false,"source":{"provider":"NRL.com","edition":"NRL.com match centre, the 2000 NRL premiership","compiler":"computed by imperialism-game from NRL.com's team lists and player stats (the NRL's own data); the positions of players who never started from the Rugby League Project","url":"https://www.nrl.com/draw/?competition=111&season=2000","retrieved":"2026-11-13","method":"computed","metric":"core points a club game: NRL Fantasy's points for the eight NRL.com stats recorded in 1999 and 2000, the season before at half weight","conversion":"No game rated the 2000 season: each overall is computed from NRL.com's match centre, the season's premiership games, regular season and finals. Players: everyone NRL.com lists taking the field (a player named off the field only with minutes or a counted stat); his club is the one he played most games for (of two as many, the last). Position: the one he started at most in the season by its team lists, whatever his jersey; else most in the seasons either side, then two either side; else the first of his positions on the Rugby League Project; else he is left out. Value: his core points a club game, NRL Fantasy's points for eleven stats (`core`: 8 a try, 5 a try assist, 4 a line break, 2 a line-break assist, 1 a tackle, -2 a missed tackle, 2 a tackle break, 4 an offload, -2 an error (where NRL.com records no errors for a game, as for every game of 2013-2015, a handling error), 1 every 10 metres run and 1 every 30 kicked; goals and field goals not counted), the season's in full and the season before's at half weight when he played in it, over his club's games in each. NRL.com recorded eight of the eleven in 2000 (`stats`: tries, try assists, line breaks, tackles, missed tackles, offloads, errors and run metres), and only they count. Overall: the value's mid-rank percentile among the season's players at his position (ties sharing one), read off `reference`, Rugby League 26's overalls at that position (scripts/data/rugby-league-26.json), as many of each 2025 club's best as the season's clubs carry per club (`quota`), by linear interpolation; rounded and held to 1-99. Club shift: the season's results set each club's level and how far apart the clubs play, while its players keep their order. Each club's Simple Rating System (`srs`), its regular season's margins adjusted for its opponents and a home edge by least squares, is scaled to the clubs' own spread, times the square root of the ratings' reliability (the share of their variance that is not their games' luck, `clubShift.reliability`), and turned into points of the match model's strength, the mean of its attack and its defence: divided by `clubShift.margin`, the points a game one point of strength is worth at the season's scoring, 0.9 (`matched`: the model's margin over its first order, over its game-to-game spread against the real game's) times the first order, 2 x 0.14 x its tries a team game (`tries`) x a try's points with a conversion at 75.5% (`tryPoints` + 1.51). Added to the built-in 2025 NRL clubs' mean model strength (`clubShift.mean`), that is its target. Every player of the club moves by a whole number (`shift`) and its `plus` best players (overall, then value) by one more, held to 1-99, whichever brings its matchday 17's model strength nearest the target (of two as near, the smaller move)."},"map":"nrl2000","clubs":[{"id":"nrl-brisbane-broncos","name":"Brisbane Broncos","code":"BRI","league":"NRL","country":"036","col":"oklch(0.72 0.16 91)","str":85.1,"squad":[["Darren Lockyer","FB",93],["Wendell Sailor","WG",92],["Michael Hancock","WG",87],["Lote Tuqiri","WG",86],["Chris Walker","WG",78],["Justin Hodges","WG",76],["Michael De Vere","CE",87],["Tonie Carroll","CE",84],["Ben Ikin","FE",80],["Shaun Berrigan","FE",79],["Kevin Walters","HB",85],["Shane Walker","HB",79],["Ben Walker","HB",78],["L